        "Closer to home, the region offers colleges affiliated to Mahatma Jyotiba Phule Rohilkhand University, private universities in Moradabad, Kumaun University colleges in Kashipur, the agricultural university at Pantnagar and, for later management study, IIM Kashipur, 12 km away. Abroad, the UK, Canada, the United States, Australia and the Gulf all read IB and IGCSE results, with predicted grades in autumn of the final year doing most of the early work.",
